| `scripts/check_structure.py` | Runs checks A–Z and the project's own checks on a bare `python3`, so pre-commit can gate without a virtual environment. Markdown scanning recognizes HTML block types 1 to 7; type 6 may interrupt paragraphs, type 7 may not, and both end before a blank line. Loader-refused project and practices files exit CONFIG, or USAGE for a conflict hunk; practices section faults exit CONFIG. Refusal and section provenance resets per run. | `make check` | [`scripts/check_structure.py --only`](settings.md#command-line-flags) | Stdlib only and 3.6-safe, so it cannot read TOML or YAML through a parser. | [deterministic-checks.md](../guides/deterministic-checks.md) | always |
